      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/ba9def/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-05-21T07:39:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi,<br><br>A few questions, that probably have obvious answers:<br><br>1. Unity basic power says, that I can destroy an equipment card to put mechanical bot into play. Does it have to be equipment that is in Unity play area, or from any hero play area?<br><br>2. Mechanical Bots are considered Hero Targets, or non-hero targets?<br><br>3. When the Environment card is dealing damage to a target with highest HP, can it target main Villain?<br><br>4. During Heroes turn, players can act in whatever order they want?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:44.132Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 2,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
