      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Hi,<br /><br />A few questions, that probably have obvious answers:<br /><br />1. Unity basic power says, that I can destroy an equipment card to put mechanical bot into play. Does it have to be equipment that is in Unity play area, or from any hero play area?<br /><br />2. Mechanical Bots are considered Hero Targets, or non-hero targets?<br /><br />3. When the Environment card is dealing damage to a target with highest HP, can it target main Villain?<br /><br />4. During Heroes turn, players can act in whatever order they want?</p>",
