      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>1 - It doesn&#39;t specify that the equipment must come from Unity&#39;s deck, therefore you can destroy any card in play which has the &quot;equipment&quot; keyword.</p><p>2 - Any card in a hero deck is a hero card. Any card with hp is a target. Therefore a card with hp in a hero deck is a hero target :).</p><p>3 - If it just says it hits &quot;the target with the highest hp&quot; then yes, it can hit the villain if they have the highest hp. If it excluded villains it&#39;d probably say &quot;hero target&quot;.</p><p>4 - Turn order is decided at the start of the game and remains the same for the whole time (unless you&#39;re playing the Wager Master but his whole thing is messing with the rules). Villain always goes first, then heroes in the same order every time, then the environment.</p>",
